  "description": "Scheduled, age-based trimming of the ImageSharp.Web image cache for Umbraco. Supports both the Azure Blob cache and the local physical cache, and keeps the cache from growing unbounded (e.g. exceeding Umbraco Cloud media-storage limits) by removing old variants in the background. Deleted variants are regenerated on the next request. Supports Umbraco 13, 17 and 18.",
